  "description": {
    "en": "The Swiss monetary base, giving both sides of central-bank money creation in one table. The origination side (foreign-currency positions, securities portfolio, money-market transactions) and the utilisation side (banknotes in circulation, sight deposits of domestic banks) sum to the same total. Seasonal adjustment is carried as its own series rather than a toggle. For money held by the public rather than central-bank money, see ch_snb_snbmonagg."
  },
